  "notes": "All England 2018 world feed, 720p source, warmer/darker hall, much heavier use of super-slow-motion replay inserts (racket/shuttle macro shots at 1327-1331 and 1311-1316) than the 2026 feed. Close-up-to-close-up cuts are under-marked at the 2 Hz marking rate. A 0.25 s dense re-check of 1449-1459 s (probe/debug/bwf-md-2018/dense) found two ~0.7 s low-angle action inserts inside one rally (1451.9-1452.6 and 1456.4-1457.1); the four cuts around them are marked and the court interval is split accordingly. This production cuts mid-rally, which the 2026 feed does not. the 1225.0 mark was relocated to 1223.4.",
